<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0022b6eaacfc77a42ab79c74> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0022b6eaacfc77a42ab79c74> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "航空炸弹弹道表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0022b6eaacfc77a42ab79c74> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "按照特定思路编制出的弹道表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:050900ea703f2f29d8308de8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:050900ea703f2f29d8308de8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹道高"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:05231e5069c0c3b2cb81b3ec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:05231e5069c0c3b2cb81b3ec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "波动阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:05231e5069c0c3b2cb81b3ec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:caa290950d87fc8aaeb516b0> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:05231e5069c0c3b2cb81b3ec> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "超声速时所特有的波动阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:06a934b8684924468170524e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:06a934b8684924468170524e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "外弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:06a934b8684924468170524e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "研究弹丸质心运动的规律问题"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:093e207f8c694796cc0ef143> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:093e207f8c694796cc0ef143> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质心"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:093e207f8c694796cc0ef143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸质量集中的点，用于简化弹丸运动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0a208b07b8784fe1740d6363> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0a208b07b8784fe1740d6363> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高射炮"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0a875f4de8b4c5baa7e394de> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0a875f4de8b4c5baa7e394de> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气迎面阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0b69b54b3d2e9eb2f66adb78> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0b69b54b3d2e9eb2f66adb78> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "三自由度方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0b69b54b3d2e9eb2f66adb78> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "考虑横风情况下建立的运动方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0d8f5853dbb8d2efe750d012> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0d8f5853dbb8d2efe750d012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刚体运动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0d8f5853dbb8d2efe750d012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸在空气中的复杂运动，包含6个自由度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0e19daae0920ba2d66def59f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0e19daae0920ba2d66def59f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "标准弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0e19daae0920ba2d66def59f> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "预先选定一个或一组特定形状的弹丸作为标准弹丸，通过风洞或射击试验的方法把它们的阻力系数曲线准确地测定出来，把它作为计算其他弹丸阻力系数的标准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fa21365893ae732135785df> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fa21365893ae732135785df> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "无风弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fa21365893ae732135785df> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fa21365893ae732135785df> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "无风条件下的弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fb04898ed8d84c0ae9869c1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fb04898ed8d84c0ae9869c1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "标准气象条件"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fb04898ed8d84c0ae9869c1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f993b89b1b596c9a6342150e> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:0fb04898ed8d84c0ae9869c1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于火炮弹道计算和编制射表的标准化气象参数集合"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:11b6c30712467178eb520780> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:11b6c30712467178eb520780> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "涡流阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:11b6c30712467178eb520780> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:caa290950d87fc8aaeb516b0> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:11b6c30712467178eb520780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "空气阻力主要由摩擦阻力、涡流阻力及超声速时所特有的波动阻力所组成"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:151ddb306c46748d7276c6f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:151ddb306c46748d7276c6f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质点弹道学"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:151ddb306c46748d7276c6f2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将弹丸当作质点研究的弹道学分支"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1525977e0706b4e76d4b9c8d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1525977e0706b4e76d4b9c8d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有风弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1525977e0706b4e76d4b9c8d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1525977e0706b4e76d4b9c8d> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "有风条件下的弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:15e8792c2bdf9eb2638cd65e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:15e8792c2bdf9eb2638cd65e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "降弧"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:15e8792c2bdf9eb2638cd65e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:15e8792c2bdf9eb2638cd65e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹道中高度下降的部分"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:167ebc801dc2754cd8c046b5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:167ebc801dc2754cd8c046b5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地面坐标系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:16bc6ce10933be2315c41695> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:16bc6ce10933be2315c41695> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "射角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:16bc6ce10933be2315c41695> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "发射时的角度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:186df1a5fbafa3a22b2e4ceb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:186df1a5fbafa3a22b2e4ceb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "相对射击面"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:186df1a5fbafa3a22b2e4ceb> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "与绝对射击面存在夹角，其夹角大小取决于v和Wz在水平面内投影大小的射击面"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1c9f3df7d0737d5a405c876c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1c9f3df7d0737d5a405c876c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "激波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1c9f3df7d0737d5a405c876c> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "超声速弹丸飞行中由气流绕内钝角转折造成的扰动积累形成的强烈压缩现象"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1dbaaaa6484ca6172144ec5c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1dbaaaa6484ca6172144ec5c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "枪弹"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1dbaaaa6484ca6172144ec5c> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "枪械发射的弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1eca2cf1755b01e415020dda> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1eca2cf1755b01e415020dda> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "初速"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1eca2cf1755b01e415020dda> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在此动参考系内的初速同样由式（1-87）求得"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1f43426c9de05636aae2ebff> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:1f43426c9de05636aae2ebff> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全水平射程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:27ae6052592af53475b345a9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:27ae6052592af53475b345a9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "切线方向"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:27ae6052592af53475b345a9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸质心速度矢量的方向"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:281a95c8c2d9ce555aff701f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:281a95c8c2d9ce555aff701f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "平流层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:281a95c8c2d9ce555aff701f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:281a95c8c2d9ce555aff701f> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "从海平面起，大气依次可分为对流层、平流层（又称同温层）、中间层（又称亚同温层）、高温层和外层大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:29ee6da8da577682f0cf422c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:29ee6da8da577682f0cf422c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "头部形状"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2a124d6ae56101fc0e431c6f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2a124d6ae56101fc0e431c6f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "附面层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2a1a3091c9cd363a6384bd7a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2a1a3091c9cd363a6384bd7a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地炮"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2a1a3091c9cd363a6384bd7a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "常常只需要知道顶点s及落点c诸元即可的火炮类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2e539de4dfda5ab1dc99c4cd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2e539de4dfda5ab1dc99c4cd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "射表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2e539de4dfda5ab1dc99c4cd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "根据标准气象条件编制的火炮射击数据表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2e7363fda3dd4db07be59021> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2e7363fda3dd4db07be59021> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "方向偏差"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2f7c8aeb61d4d6940e50ad61> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2f7c8aeb61d4d6940e50ad61> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地表大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2f7c8aeb61d4d6940e50ad61> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "处于热平衡状态，此层气温恒定不变，大气没有上下对流，只有水平移动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2fb225315fa3dc0da1923d5f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:2fb225315fa3dc0da1923d5f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气总阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3187e5c462958c587f423c37> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3187e5c462958c587f423c37> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "对流层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3187e5c462958c587f423c37> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3187e5c462958c587f423c37> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "从海平面起，大气依次可分为对流层、平流层（又称同温层）、中间层（又称亚同温层）、高温层和外层大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:31d81c26f7239dcd9c5e1efd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:31d81c26f7239dcd9c5e1efd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "非标准条件"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:31d81c26f7239dcd9c5e1efd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "相对于标准条件来说的条件，包括考虑地球曲率及重力加速度变化、气压、气温和纵、横风的变化。"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3367989f14e627c20c3cd976> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3367989f14e627c20c3cd976> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "重力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3367989f14e627c20c3cd976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "作用于弹丸上的力之一"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:343a1c2489a659d0625f37db> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:343a1c2489a659d0625f37db> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "外弹道学"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:348c3bcf46524830394a46e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:348c3bcf46524830394a46e2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地面曲率"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:348c3bcf46524830394a46e2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "地球表面的曲率特征"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3637a04b962a202efae67701> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3637a04b962a202efae67701> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "非标准气象条件下的气压函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3637a04b962a202efae67701> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:80233816417cd01eb85e648a> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3637a04b962a202efae67701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "非标准气象条件下的气压函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3941bc00284d38219c27c6ec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3941bc00284d38219c27c6ec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "离心惯性力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3941bc00284d38219c27c6ec> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "地球旋转的影响之一，已在重力中加以考虑"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3b58e5e319355f9967266010> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3b58e5e319355f9967266010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "法线方向"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3b58e5e319355f9967266010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "与切线方向垂直的方向"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3dd08df61b546882b245a79e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3dd08df61b546882b245a79e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹带波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3dd08df61b546882b245a79e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f79f35e6f29b66e30cedaf46> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3dd08df61b546882b245a79e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "由弹带处产生的弹道波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3f44daf6435054ee45f37428> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3f44daf6435054ee45f37428> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "声速"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:3f44daf6435054ee45f37428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "介质中声音传播的速度，文中指当地声速和地面标准值"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4013395446a90f6a9f087bcf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4013395446a90f6a9f087bcf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:41ab468d7a31898834dddbd2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:41ab468d7a31898834dddbd2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "火炮"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:41ab468d7a31898834dddbd2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "进行弹道计算和射击的武器系统"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4223820fee0114c205d127f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4223820fee0114c205d127f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质心"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4223820fee0114c205d127f2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸的质量中心，是重力与空气阻力作用的参考点"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:42cc7218020ec12d014477f1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:42cc7218020ec12d014477f1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "分离波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:42cc7218020ec12d014477f1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "正激波与斜激波组成的波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:49d57273241c4213d0c23354> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:49d57273241c4213d0c23354> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "火炮弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:49d57273241c4213d0c23354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "火炮发射的弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4b8b8304162de05646a89a1f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4b8b8304162de05646a89a1f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "流体静力学基本方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4b8b8304162de05646a89a1f> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "利用流体静力学基本方程和气体状态方程求出大气气压"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4bc8bec4b08bd444266944eb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4bc8bec4b08bd444266944eb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "状态方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4bc8bec4b08bd444266944eb> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于得到空气密度函数标准定律和标准分布的方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4ca366ee9c6e2c4a35230a5e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4ca366ee9c6e2c4a35230a5e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "迫击炮弹"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4ca366ee9c6e2c4a35230a5e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "具有特定最大射程角的炮弹类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4e791884e3624702833da8c5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4e791884e3624702833da8c5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "密度函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4e791884e3624702833da8c5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "表示空气特征的函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4f53d9871741873c127843f0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4f53d9871741873c127843f0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "中间层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4f53d9871741873c127843f0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4f53d9871741873c127843f0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "从海平面起，大气依次可分为对流层、平流层（又称同温层）、中间层（又称亚同温层）、高温层和外层大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4fcba3456cf06309d776eaef> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4fcba3456cf06309d776eaef> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "侧偏"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:4fcba3456cf06309d776eaef> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹道在横向发生的偏移"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5233266477fac850dfc8acb0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5233266477fac850dfc8acb0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地面火炮外弹道表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5233266477fac850dfc8acb0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "按照特定思路编制出的弹道表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5262a412adb87f6333d4e778> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5262a412adb87f6333d4e778> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "射程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5262a412adb87f6333d4e778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸飞行的水平距离"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5460cb3a3594a21706d5e2fd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5460cb3a3594a21706d5e2fd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质点平面运动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5460cb3a3594a21706d5e2fd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在特定假设下，弹丸刚体一般运动简化成的在其发射面内的运动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:54b0a96c6a899d3aa6309c14> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:54b0a96c6a899d3aa6309c14> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "穿甲弹"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:54b0a96c6a899d3aa6309c14> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:77d9ce7ad19dfc27f99d614a> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:54b0a96c6a899d3aa6309c14> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "一种具有特定质量系数范围的弹丸类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:55699fd1db8eecdd4d7049ae> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:55699fd1db8eecdd4d7049ae> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气阻力函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:55699fd1db8eecdd4d7049ae> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "表示弹丸相对于空气的运动速度对弹丸运动的影响部分"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:57054db36141ca6ffd3a58dd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:57054db36141ca6ffd3a58dd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "理想气体"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:57054db36141ca6ffd3a58dd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "空气可近似看成的气体模型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:58cba30533b55f2bbe96f958> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:58cba30533b55f2bbe96f958> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "横风"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:58cba30533b55f2bbe96f958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "通过改变空气阻力的方向来影响弹道的风"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5be43a9e63c9cbf14bd05ea2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5be43a9e63c9cbf14bd05ea2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质心运动方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:5be43a9e63c9cbf14bd05ea2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "描述有风情况下质心运动的方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:641e268b45540864e2254cbd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:641e268b45540864e2254cbd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "动能"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:656152a94162fcde08a0f8e1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:656152a94162fcde08a0f8e1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大气微小单元体"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:667d7d6db47a9f4710041156> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:667d7d6db47a9f4710041156> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "自然坐标系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:667d7d6db47a9f4710041156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "根据跟随弹丸质心运动的方向而取的坐标"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:67339ede95d5f40d65f21cf7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:67339ede95d5f40d65f21cf7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气阻力加速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:67339ede95d5f40d65f21cf7> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于便于写出弹丸运动的微分方程而专门阐述的概念"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6808bf460bf94dacbcdc7b4f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6808bf460bf94dacbcdc7b4f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "正激波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad54557e9cb42daf019f791> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad54557e9cb42daf019f791> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "外层大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad54557e9cb42daf019f791> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad54557e9cb42daf019f791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "从海平面起，大气依次可分为对流层、平流层（又称同温层）、中间层（又称亚同温层）、高温层和外层大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad723b7194166cfb24350fc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad723b7194166cfb24350fc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "同温层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad723b7194166cfb24350fc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:2f7c8aeb61d4d6940e50ad61> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6ad723b7194166cfb24350fc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "气温恒定不变，大气没有上下对流，只有水平移动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6cdf968aa148b291a5570ab1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6cdf968aa148b291a5570ab1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "超声速弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6cdf968aa148b291a5570ab1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "飞行速度超过声速的弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6e473e6616e1285709c234f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6e473e6616e1285709c234f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "真空弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6e473e6616e1285709c234f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6e473e6616e1285709c234f2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在真空中运动的弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6fcb6fe42d73b8dede0189f5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6fcb6fe42d73b8dede0189f5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质点弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:6fcb6fe42d73b8dede0189f5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将弹丸质量集中于质心一点的一种弹丸运动的规律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:711c769bc53fd58cbf8644ca> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:711c769bc53fd58cbf8644ca> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "迎面阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:711c769bc53fd58cbf8644ca> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在弹丸轴对称且章动角忽略不计的假设下，通过弹丸质心的空气阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:7235253c3728e0dbe5216bdd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:7235253c3728e0dbe5216bdd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质点弹道方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:7235253c3728e0dbe5216bdd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在特定基本假设下建立的反映弹丸质心运动主要规律的方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:76e774f599162b8d6d6f9634> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:76e774f599162b8d6d6f9634> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "章动角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:76e774f599162b8d6d6f9634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "绕轴旋转体中相当于攻角的夹角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:77d9ce7ad19dfc27f99d614a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:77d9ce7ad19dfc27f99d614a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:77d9ce7ad19dfc27f99d614a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在空气中飞行的物体，受到重力、空气阻力和科氏惯性力作用"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:7cdf8f6615fbf24d63de06de> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:7cdf8f6615fbf24d63de06de> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸运动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:80233816417cd01eb85e648a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:80233816417cd01eb85e648a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "气压函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:80233816417cd01eb85e648a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "按大气平衡条件导出的气压函数，除地面气压值随地点、时间变化较大外，气压随高度分布规律差异很小。"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:81df71119b06ceddcb9f7948> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:81df71119b06ceddcb9f7948> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "标准定律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:81df71119b06ceddcb9f7948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "空气密度函数的标准定律 H(y)"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8310712de78b638430052fe5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8310712de78b638430052fe5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地球表面曲率"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8310712de78b638430052fe5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "地球表面的弯曲程度，影响弹丸运动方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:84f29371c847c32e55586fd0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:84f29371c847c32e55586fd0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "绝对射击面"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:84f29371c847c32e55586fd0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "与相对射击面存在夹角，其夹角大小取决于v和Wz在水平面内投影大小的射击面"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:85725c736e01ee3e819cc5e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:85725c736e01ee3e819cc5e2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "动参考系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:85725c736e01ee3e819cc5e2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "以相同速度从左向右运动的大气作为参考系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:85c0e27bb85e3f0e46644ac8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:85c0e27bb85e3f0e46644ac8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:85c0e27bb85e3f0e46644ac8> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "受纵风影响大小和方向的力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸飞行的介质，产生空气阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:870b1add4ba331466cf778c8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:870b1add4ba331466cf778c8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高温层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:870b1add4ba331466cf778c8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:8610daa85c85b752f3da4ae1> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:870b1add4ba331466cf778c8> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "从海平面起，大气依次可分为对流层、平流层（又称同温层）、中间层（又称亚同温层）、高温层和外层大气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:875751970c2b0f975faae31e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:875751970c2b0f975faae31e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "外弹道射表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:875751970c2b0f975faae31e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "以C、v0、θ0和t为变量的x、y、v的数值计算表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8c01f45e891d1a82218b2f03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8c01f45e891d1a82218b2f03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "标准条件"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8c01f45e891d1a82218b2f03> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "非标准条件所相对的基准条件。"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8d4909db0affd9fbb892d3ac> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8d4909db0affd9fbb892d3ac> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质心运动"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8d4909db0affd9fbb892d3ac> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸质心在空中运动的规律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8d9cd8544fb38efc44c626c9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8d9cd8544fb38efc44c626c9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "顶点"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8d9cd8544fb38efc44c626c9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "地炮诸元之一，用s表示"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8eac15c09d20e57a9ee46672> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8eac15c09d20e57a9ee46672> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大气层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8ef2b19925bb2e665c5aefd1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8ef2b19925bb2e665c5aefd1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹形系数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:8ef2b19925bb2e665c5aefd1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "某一形状的弹丸在相同马赫数下其阻力系数与标准弹阻力系数的比值称为弹形系数 i。"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9132761bd97d02e570110b48> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9132761bd97d02e570110b48> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "绝对弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:91ce35ba134e539f80f32aab> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:91ce35ba134e539f80f32aab> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "低伸弹道表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:91ce35ba134e539f80f32aab> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "按照特定思路编制出的弹道表"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9207af458c3ac86c8a06c523> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9207af458c3ac86c8a06c523> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "基本假设"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9207af458c3ac86c8a06c523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "为了使问题简化并反映弹丸质心运动主要规律而引入的假设条件"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:929d48d802d9d93b08d650c7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:929d48d802d9d93b08d650c7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阻力函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:93b0bf502f9ea68be7a5f0e6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:93b0bf502f9ea68be7a5f0e6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹头部"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:93b0bf502f9ea68be7a5f0e6> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸的头部，其形状影响波动阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:952676ce53f2e3ed81942993> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:952676ce53f2e3ed81942993> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "直角坐标系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:952676ce53f2e3ed81942993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于投影矢量方程并建立弹丸质心运动微分方程组的坐标系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:968dd036cbb1eb2b073ae010> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:968dd036cbb1eb2b073ae010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:968dd036cbb1eb2b073ae010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "气温分布的自变量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:98a39322e570dd2a69ea5cfc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:98a39322e570dd2a69ea5cfc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "惯性参考系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:98a39322e570dd2a69ea5cfc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:85725c736e01ee3e819cc5e2> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:98a39322e570dd2a69ea5cfc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "速度为常量的参考系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9adae88be4b10b8249e2b028> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9adae88be4b10b8249e2b028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "湿空气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9adae88be4b10b8249e2b028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:dd4a875013d7c403c4474d9c> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9adae88be4b10b8249e2b028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "含有水蒸气的空气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b6dec0fa06e56840f100786> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b6dec0fa06e56840f100786> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "坐标系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b6dec0fa06e56840f100786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "动坐标系"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b9ad65e4c676b1bade01be6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b9ad65e4c676b1bade01be6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "摩擦阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b9ad65e4c676b1bade01be6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:caa290950d87fc8aaeb516b0> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9b9ad65e4c676b1bade01be6> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "空气阻力主要由摩擦阻力、涡流阻力及超声速时所特有的波动阻力所组成"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9c007bd9a769f6055ddad6bd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9c007bd9a769f6055ddad6bd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "标准分布"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9c007bd9a769f6055ddad6bd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "空气密度函数的标准分布 H_s(y)"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9cfca5efa3f83029100afe95> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:9cfca5efa3f83029100afe95> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阻力加速度矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a1c5de9e17a8e98685d2ffd4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a1c5de9e17a8e98685d2ffd4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹头波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a1c5de9e17a8e98685d2ffd4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f79f35e6f29b66e30cedaf46> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a1c5de9e17a8e98685d2ffd4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "由弹丸头部产生的弹道波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a4ca4683271ed9278db701d5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a4ca4683271ed9278db701d5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "层流边界层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a4ca4683271ed9278db701d5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:a9616422d2c4fae158c58c16> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a4ca4683271ed9278db701d5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在接近弹丸的很小区域内存在的边界层类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a9616422d2c4fae158c58c16> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a9616422d2c4fae158c58c16> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "边界层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:a9616422d2c4fae158c58c16> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸高速运动时在其表面附近形成的流体层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:aa0ffc2b6a3e4cf3c4be2230> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:aa0ffc2b6a3e4cf3c4be2230> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气密度函数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:aa0ffc2b6a3e4cf3c4be2230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "根据状态方程得到的标准定律 H(y)"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ab5535496be93f3d62be3477> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ab5535496be93f3d62be3477> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "重力加速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ab5535496be93f3d62be3477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在外弹道计算中方向垂直于地平面的矢量，在特定范围内量值变化不大可视为常数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:acb40cfb9baf8fe6f9b479a5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:acb40cfb9baf8fe6f9b479a5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "升弧"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:acb40cfb9baf8fe6f9b479a5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:acb40cfb9baf8fe6f9b479a5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹道中高度上升的部分"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:af99b72277973bad863483c0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:af99b72277973bad863483c0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "亚同温层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:af99b72277973bad863483c0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "对流层与平流层之间的过渡层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:afded0cb97a57c923d6f4ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:afded0cb97a57c923d6f4ca1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大气气压"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:afded0cb97a57c923d6f4ca1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "求出大气气压"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b4d4729dd1b065bb361c5faf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b4d4729dd1b065bb361c5faf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高射火炮"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b4d4729dd1b065bb361c5faf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "可用数值计算编制以C、v0、θ0和t为变量的x、y、v的外弹道射表的火炮类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b4f3ddd9a97461d203489bb7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b4f3ddd9a97461d203489bb7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "气温"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b4f3ddd9a97461d203489bb7> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "随高度变化的温度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b82bea9211186db98b92f6d5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b82bea9211186db98b92f6d5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "相对弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b82bea9211186db98b92f6d5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b82bea9211186db98b92f6d5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在动参考系内所观察的弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b8f1b0dec8381bd5d6668033> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b8f1b0dec8381bd5d6668033> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大口径高初速远程炮弹"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:b8f1b0dec8381bd5d6668033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "具有特定最大射程角范围的炮弹类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bb6cf439858c8b02b0423ea3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bb6cf439858c8b02b0423ea3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "加速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bb6cf439858c8b02b0423ea3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "dv/dt 可以看成 v 的矢端速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bcaaee43ea1a53d07f516b88> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bcaaee43ea1a53d07f516b88> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "炮兵用温度随高度的标准分布"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bcaaee43ea1a53d07f516b88> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "根据交界层面温度及温度随高度的变化率连续的条件得到的温度随高度分布"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bf9e155f9a1798542f4d5ab9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bf9e155f9a1798542f4d5ab9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "气压和密度随高度分布的标准分布"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bf9e155f9a1798542f4d5ab9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "有了温度随高度的分布，就可以利用流体静力学基本方程和气体状态方程求出大气气压"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bfa3ea3cfe2f052725da870d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bfa3ea3cfe2f052725da870d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "科氏加速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:bfa3ea3cfe2f052725da870d> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "等于地球自转角速度矢量和弹丸速度乘积的2倍"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c0cf945806908a03d82c1467> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c0cf945806908a03d82c1467> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "攻角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c0cf945806908a03d82c1467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "飞行中弹丸轴线和弹丸速度矢量之间的夹角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c224cc48c70a0304ffcace65> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c224cc48c70a0304ffcace65> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "重力加速度矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c383d3d4a4d716a3531fdb40> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c383d3d4a4d716a3531fdb40> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "科氏惯性力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c383d3d4a4d716a3531fdb40> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "作用于弹丸上的力之一"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c73cf7641c3fa14b061b366c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c73cf7641c3fa14b061b366c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气阻力定律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c73cf7641c3fa14b061b366c> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "标准弹的阻力系数 Cx0 与 Ma 的函数关系称为空气阻力定律。"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c78553b3fabc7a28c2e8b7af> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c78553b3fabc7a28c2e8b7af> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "微分方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c7faaab8b374b015fbb1d4d1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:c7faaab8b374b015fbb1d4d1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "横风偏"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:caa290950d87fc8aaeb516b0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:caa290950d87fc8aaeb516b0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:caa290950d87fc8aaeb516b0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "作用于弹丸上的力之一，来自空气的阻力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cb8bc0e0249ca761d18748aa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cb8bc0e0249ca761d18748aa> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质心速度矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cb97ba565be38e1158e053ed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cb97ba565be38e1158e053ed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质心运动微分方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cb97ba565be38e1158e053ed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于分析弹丸运动规律的微分方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cc84948e6fdf6b6bff0282ed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cc84948e6fdf6b6bff0282ed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹道系数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ccf0f583bf2af5da81d0767c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ccf0f583bf2af5da81d0767c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "气体状态方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ccf0f583bf2af5da81d0767c> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "利用流体静力学基本方程和气体状态方程求出大气气压"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cd22d89a60549c8d8ab78dc3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cd22d89a60549c8d8ab78dc3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气阻力矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cd22d89a60549c8d8ab78dc3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸在空气中运动时受到的阻力矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cec5919330602d1fd64b8d5e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cec5919330602d1fd64b8d5e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "最大射程角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:cec5919330602d1fd64b8d5e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "某一弹丸用同一速度射击，其全水平射程为最大时所对应的射角称为该弹丸在该初速时的最大射程角"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d0c6911fce4271c67f05ecd2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d0c6911fce4271c67f05ecd2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气质点弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d0c6911fce4271c67f05ecd2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "空气质点弹道的一般特性"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d173993d6c6f481710ba72e1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d173993d6c6f481710ba72e1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杀伤爆破弹"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d173993d6c6f481710ba72e1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:77d9ce7ad19dfc27f99d614a> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d173993d6c6f481710ba72e1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "一种具有特定质量系数范围的弹丸类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d38e85cab5a6a6278cae92a3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d38e85cab5a6a6278cae92a3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地球自转角速度矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d38e85cab5a6a6278cae92a3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于计算科氏加速度的物理量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d40b78d29ebf64bdc1a23043> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d40b78d29ebf64bdc1a23043> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d40b78d29ebf64bdc1a23043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "受空气阻力影响，不对称于顶点的弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d5b2b5a5914bfa265f59aa5a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:d5b2b5a5914bfa265f59aa5a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "表面粗糙度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:daa0d248bc18255efb557a55> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:daa0d248bc18255efb557a55> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "科氏力"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:db2692f3b70af139acd66c67> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:db2692f3b70af139acd66c67> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "中口径中初速炮弹"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:db2692f3b70af139acd66c67> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "具有特定最大射程角范围的炮弹类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:dd4a875013d7c403c4474d9c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:dd4a875013d7c403c4474d9c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "空气"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:dd4a875013d7c403c4474d9c> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "可近似看成理想气体的介质"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:de358560095201f753891955> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:de358560095201f753891955> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹道规律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:de358560095201f753891955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "定性地了解弹道规律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:df7bd858629de41fb63732ec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:df7bd858629de41fb63732ec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "斜激波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e102b36594cd488f4dacb3cd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e102b36594cd488f4dacb3cd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "绝对速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e102b36594cd488f4dacb3cd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸相对于地面的速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e32fb6eba56a65b41fa5287b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e32fb6eba56a65b41fa5287b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "运动方程组"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e797fcfab3e41d987c799f14> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:e797fcfab3e41d987c799f14> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "射程偏差"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eb29d56bc2ad248bc51732a0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eb29d56bc2ad248bc51732a0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "气象诸元"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eb29d56bc2ad248bc51732a0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:f993b89b1b596c9a6342150e> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eb29d56bc2ad248bc51732a0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "描述气象条件的具体参数，包括温度、气压、水汽压和相对湿度等"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ebf8c2a872788ed6fb533de8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ebf8c2a872788ed6fb533de8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹道弧长"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ebf8c2a872788ed6fb533de8> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "可作为自变量来列写描述弹丸质心运动规律的微分方程组的变量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eccbed4f25c530d388974e35> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eccbed4f25c530d388974e35> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "43年阻力定律"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eccbed4f25c530d388974e35> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "我国编制高射炮、地面火炮和低伸弹道表的依据"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ee2985b979269c5b6a747b17> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ee2985b979269c5b6a747b17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质量系数"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ee2985b979269c5b6a747b17> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸质量与直径立方之比的系数，单位为 kg/dm³"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eeae460ff0d862c7ea1be8f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:eeae460ff0d862c7ea1be8f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "地面火炮"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f31a9dd0708e1ea57b4e3492> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f31a9dd0708e1ea57b4e3492> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全飞行时间"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f31a9dd0708e1ea57b4e3492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸从发射到落地所经历的总时间"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f429c9a8675edc0b509e079e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f429c9a8675edc0b509e079e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸质心运动微分方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f429c9a8675edc0b509e079e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸质心运动微分方程的解法"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f492ec825acc4c8737449e05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f492ec825acc4c8737449e05> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "相对速度矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f492ec825acc4c8737449e05> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸相对于空气的速度矢量"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f5e94deeaa7884e6d0375f61> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f5e94deeaa7884e6d0375f61> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸运动方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f5e94deeaa7884e6d0375f61> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "考虑科氏惯性力时的弹丸运动方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6bed75bad677f343b8a986a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6bed75bad677f343b8a986a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "混合边界层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6bed75bad677f343b8a986a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:a9616422d2c4fae158c58c16> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6bed75bad677f343b8a986a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "弹丸高速运动时通常形成的边界层类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6cdf3f6dabe446c11ff3544> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6cdf3f6dabe446c11ff3544> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "退电"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f6cdf3f6dabe446c11ff3544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "当炸弹落地时飞机与炸弹的水平距离（设飞机匀速直线飞行）"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹道"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f7799e469b1034028cacd4a7> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "火炮射击时弹丸的运动轨迹，需根据气象条件进行计算和修正"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f79f35e6f29b66e30cedaf46> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f79f35e6f29b66e30cedaf46> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹道波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f79f35e6f29b66e30cedaf46> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "超声速弹丸飞行中所形成的波"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f907773559122f5bf0068bfb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f907773559122f5bf0068bfb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "重力加速度变化"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f907773559122f5bf0068bfb> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "重力加速度随位置或高度的变化，影响弹丸运动方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f993b89b1b596c9a6342150e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f993b89b1b596c9a6342150e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "气象条件"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:f993b89b1b596c9a6342150e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "随地点、时间和高度变化的环境因素，影响火炮弹道计算与修正"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:fecb5c201aac0613c709495f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:fecb5c201aac0613c709495f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "湍流边界层"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:fecb5c201aac0613c709495f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:a9616422d2c4fae158c58c16> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:fecb5c201aac0613c709495f> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "层流边界层后面转化形成的边界层类型"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ff0676ed29a29545cda3afd9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ff0676ed29a29545cda3afd9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "纵风"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ff0676ed29a29545cda3afd9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "既能影响阻力的大小，又能影响阻力的方向，从而改变射程的风"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ff744a9a945a6452322878f5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ff744a9a945a6452322878f5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弹丸速度"@zh .
<urn:kg:chapter1:class:ff744a9a945a6452322878f5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "用于计算科氏加速度的物理量"@zh .
